\ulnone\cf2 Catching a dangerous tumor or detecting heart abnormalities early can be critical. As Dr. Kishore puts it, imagine if the Titanic had shifted by a degree when it left port - it probably would have missed the iceberg. At the same time, many devices and tests are causing people to get worked up over ice cubes.}
