\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Full-body scans can detect cancers and other issues life-savingly early, but they can also lead to a lot of unnecessary spending, testing, and anxiety. If you look hard enough, you'll almost always find something. It's only after expensive, invasive follow-ups that you discover that little something was often nothing.}
